{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@, %lld of %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@, %2$lld dari %3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@, %lld of %lld, story complete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@, %2$lld dari %3$lld, cerita selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld of %lld stories complete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld dari %2$lld cerita selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "*yawn* …Is that tuna I smell? Pinch a little bit for me." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "*menguap* …Apa ini bau tuna? Cubitkan sedikit untukku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3D Models" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Model 3D"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mischievous ghost is waiting to haunt you. Point your camera at the floor or a table and he'll rise right out of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu jahil sedang menunggu untuk menghantuimu. Arahkan kamera ke lantai atau meja, dan dia akan muncul dari sana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mischievous ghost is waiting to haunt you. Summon him and he'll rise from behind your head and settle right on top of it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu jahil sedang menunggu untuk menghantuimu. Panggil dia, dan dia akan muncul dari belakang kepalamu lalu berdiam di atasnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pirate ghost who lost his ship, his crew, and his map. He kept the hat, though, and he still shouts \"Arrr!\" at every bathtub he sees." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu bajak laut yang kehilangan kapal, awak, dan petanya. Topinya masih dia simpan, dan dia masih berteriak \"Arrr!\" setiap kali melihat bak mandi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny witch who never learned to steer her broom, so she just flies in circles. Her spells mostly turn tea into slightly colder tea." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyihir mungil yang tidak pernah belajar mengendalikan sapunya, jadi dia hanya terbang berputar-putar. Mantranya kebanyakan cuma mengubah teh menjadi teh yang sedikit lebih dingin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abracadabra!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abrakadabra!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ah, my mistake. This is my grass-trimming list. Point to the grass that needs trimming." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ah, saya keliru. Ini daftar potong rumput saya. Tunjukkan rumput yang perlu dipotong."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow camera access in Settings to summon the ghost." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Izinkan akses kamera di Pengaturan untuk memanggil hantu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Almost there! Every spell needs a thumbs up to work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sedikit lagi! Setiap mantra butuh acungan jempol supaya berhasil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appears on a floor or table" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muncul di lantai atau meja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AR Ghost does not collect, store, or share any personal data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AR Ghost tidak mengumpulkan, menyimpan, atau membagikan data pribadi apa pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AR Ghost uses the camera to show ghosts around you and to detect your hand gestures. Camera images are processed on your device and never leave it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AR Ghost memakai kamera untuk menampilkan hantu di sekitarmu dan mendeteksi gestur tanganmu. Gambar kamera diproses di perangkatmu dan tidak pernah dikirim ke mana pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ARRR!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ARRR!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ARRR! Land ho! Shout \"Arrr!\" with me, matey!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ARRR! Daratan! Teriak \"Arrr!\" bersamaku, kawan!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BACK TO THE REAL WORLD" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KEMBALI KE ALAM NYATA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blow a kiss" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kirim cium jauh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boo always opens his arms for a hug. Sadly, every hug goes right through you, but he never stops trying." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boo selalu membuka tangannya untuk memelukmu. Sayangnya, setiap pelukannya tembus begitu saja, tapi dia tidak pernah berhenti mencoba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boo Buddy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Boo Buddy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BOO!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BAA!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BOSS FIGHT! Punch the boss!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LAWAN BOS! Tinju bosnya!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by %@, licensed under %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "oleh %1$@, lisensi %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Captain Boo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapten Boo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caught!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ketangkap!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change his form" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ubah wujudnya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cheese!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cheese!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clap to summon %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tepuk tangan untuk memanggil %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "COIN!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KOIN!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cover your face" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutup wajahmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Credits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kredit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delicious! Now let's groom together. Stick out your tongue!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enak! Sekarang ayo menjilat bulu bareng. Julurkan lidahmu!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't be fooled by his cute looks! He loves to settle on top of people's heads and slowly drain the sadness from their aura. If your head suddenly feels heavy, he might be the culprit..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jangan tertipu dengan bentuk lucunya! Dia senang menetap di atas kepala manusia dan perlahan-lahan menyedot aura kesedihanmu. Kalau kepalamu tiba-tiba terasa berat, mungkin dia pelakunya..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selesai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every captain needs a parrot, so I'll be yours! A true pirate winks with one eye." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Setiap kapten butuh burung beo, jadi aku jadi beomu! Bajak laut sejati berkedip dengan satu mata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every ghost asks for a secret hand sign: a thumbs up, a wave, a peace sign… Do it in front of the camera to hear the rest of its story." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiap hantu meminta isyarat tangan rahasia: jempol, lambaian, tanda damai… Lakukan di depan kamera untuk mendengar kelanjutan ceritanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every ghost asks for a secret move: a smile, a wink, a wave… Do it and the ghost hops to your shoulder, your hand, or your face to tell you more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tiap hantu meminta gerakan rahasia: senyum, kedipan, lambaian… Lakukan, dan hantu akan melompat ke pundak, tangan, atau wajahmu untuk bercerita lebih banyak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fine, you win. Have you seen a little witch flying in circles? Her broom can't turn…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Oke, kamu menang. Pernah lihat penyihir cilik yang terbang berputar-putar? Sapunya tidak bisa belok…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends share secrets. Open your palm and I'll read your fortune line…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teman saling berbagi rahasia. Buka telapak tanganmu, akan kubaca garis nasibmu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Teman!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ghost info" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Info hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give a thumbs up" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acungkan jempol"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good evening. Forgive the intrusion. Kindly return my greeting with a nod." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selamat malam. Maaf mengganggu. Mohon balas salam saya dengan anggukan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hehe!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hehe!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hehe… let's play hide and seek. Cover your face and count!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hehe… ayo main petak umpet. Tutup wajahmu dan berhitung!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hello? HELLO? Can anybody see me? Wave if you can!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halo? HALO? Ada yang bisa melihatku? Lambaikan tangan kalau bisa!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi hi!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai hai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides around your head, shoulders, and hands" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bersembunyi di sekitar kepala, pundak, dan tanganmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hmph!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmph!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hmph. I feel… calm. In the next grave over, there's a ghost who badly wants a hug." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hmph. Aku jadi… tenang. Di kuburan sebelah, ada hantu yang ingin sekali dipeluk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold both hands together in front of the camera until the circle fills up. He might not stay cute..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Satukan kedua tangan di depan kamera sampai lingkarannya penuh. Dia belum tentu tetap imut..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hug!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peluk!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm clinging to you! Hug me, touch me with your hand!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aku menempel padamu! Peluk aku, sentuh aku dengan tanganmu!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "INSERT COIN. Pinch a coin to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MASUKKAN KOIN. Cubit koin untuk lanjut."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It worked! My first hug ever. My friend Wavy is still waving at people who never wave back…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berhasil! Pelukan pertamaku. Temanku Wavy masih melambai pada orang-orang yang tak pernah membalas…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It worked! The tea became… slightly colder tea. Oh, a very polite guest is knocking…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Berhasil! Tehnya berubah jadi… teh yang sedikit lebih dingin. Oh, ada tamu yang sangat sopan mengetuk pintu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "K.O.!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "K.O.!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LET'S GO" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AYO MULAI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Liar! Prove you're brave. Punch me, if you can!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bohong! Buktikan kamu berani. Tinju aku, kalau bisa!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Little Witch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Penyihir Cilik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a fist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kepalkan tangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meet Mister Q" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kenalan dengan Mister Q"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missed! I'm right in front of you. BOO! Did I scare you?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Meleset! Aku tepat di depanmu. BAA! Kaget, kan?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mister Q (The Cute Ghost)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mister Q (Si Hantu Imut)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mister Q (True Form)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mister Q (Wujud Asli)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mlem!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mlem!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi loved napping so much that she kept doing it in the afterlife. Her ears still twitch whenever someone opens a can of tuna." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mochi sangat suka tidur siang sampai-sampai dia terus melakukannya di alam baka. Telinganya masih bergerak setiap kali ada yang membuka kaleng tuna."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi the Ghost Cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mochi si Kucing Hantu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mochi's twin sister prefers dark corners. Her glowing eyes look spooky, but she only wants to knock your things off the table." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saudari kembar Mochi ini lebih suka sudut yang gelap. Matanya yang menyala terlihat seram, padahal dia cuma ingin menjatuhkan barang-barangmu dari meja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Music" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Musik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mwah!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muah!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My sincere apologies. By the way, a pirate keeps asking where the nearest bathtub is…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mohon maaf yang sebesar-besarnya. Ngomong-ngomong, ada bajak laut yang terus bertanya di mana bak mandi terdekat…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NEXT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LANJUT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nobody has ever hugged me back. Maybe a kiss from afar works?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Belum pernah ada yang membalas pelukanku. Mungkin cium jauh bisa?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nod your head" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Anggukkan kepala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nori the Shadow Cat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nori si Kucing Bayangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nanti Saja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now I have a friend! Psst… something furry just fell asleep on top of your head…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekarang aku punya teman! Psst… ada yang berbulu baru saja tertidur di atas kepalamu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only people who can see ghosts know the secret signal. Wink at me!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hanya orang yang bisa melihat hantu yang tahu kode rahasianya. Kedipkan matamu!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OOF!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ADUH!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ooh, fancy!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ooh, keren!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ooh, that smile tastes sweet! Will you be my friend? Nod if yes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ooh, senyummu manis sekali! Mau jadi temanku? Angguk kalau mau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPEN SETTINGS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BUKA PENGATURAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open your mouth wide" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Buka mulut lebar-lebar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Peekaboo!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cilukba!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Phew, thank you! Help me cast a spell. Open your mouth wide: ABRACADABRA!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiuh, terima kasih! Bantu aku merapal mantra. Buka mulutmu lebar-lebar: ABRAKADABRA!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Phew…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fiuh…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photos you take are kept only in memory until you share or save them yourself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Foto yang kamu ambil hanya disimpan di memori sampai kamu sendiri membagikan atau menyimpannya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your ghost. Cute… until it isn't." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pilih hantumu. Lucu… sampai dia berubah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pinch your fingers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cubitkan jarimu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pixel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pixel escaped from an old arcade game. He still thinks in squares, and he jumps whenever he hears a coin drop into a machine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pixel kabur dari mesin game arkade tua. Dia masih berpikir serba kotak, dan selalu kaget setiap kali mendengar koin masuk ke mesin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play their story" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mainkan ceritanya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PLAYER 1 READY? Thumbs up to start!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PLAYER 1 SIAP? Acungkan jempol untuk mulai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point the front camera at your face." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arahkan kamera depan ke wajahmu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point your finger" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tunjuk dengan jarimu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poof!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puf!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Privasi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Psst!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Psst!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Puff your cheeks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gembungkan pipimu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Punch the ghost!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tinju hantunya!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purrfect human. My twin sister Nori hides in the dark. Careful, she loves to play tricks…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Manusia yang sempurna. Saudari kembarku, Nori, bersembunyi di kegelapan. Hati-hati, dia suka jahil…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purr…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Purr…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise your eyebrows" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Angkat alismu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Raise your hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Angkat tanganmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pengaturan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shake your head" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gelengkan kepala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SHARE" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "BAGIKAN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show a peace sign" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tunjukkan tanda damai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show an open palm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tunjukkan telapak terbuka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Tutorial" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tampilkan Tutorial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sir Reaper" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuan Pencabut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lewati"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smile" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tersenyum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sniff sniff… your aura smells a little sour today. Can you smile for me?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endus endus… auramu agak asam hari ini. Mau tersenyum untukku?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snip snip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kres kres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound & Haptics" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Suara & Getaran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sound Effects" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Efek Suara"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Splendid." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Luar biasa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Squawk!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kwaak!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "START!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MULAI!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay very still" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diam, jangan bergerak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick out your tongue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Julurkan lidahmu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story complete!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cerita selesai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SUMMON THE GHOST" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PANGGIL HANTU"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summoning the ghost…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memanggil hantu…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take a photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ambil foto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Terima kasih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app has no accounts, no analytics, no ads, and no tracking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aplikasi ini tidak punya akun, analitik, iklan, maupun pelacakan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is paused." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamera sedang dijeda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera is used only while the ghost is on screen, to show it in augmented reality and to detect your face and hand gestures. All camera images are processed on your device in real time and are never saved or sent anywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamera hanya dipakai selama hantu tampil di layar, untuk menampilkannya dalam augmented reality dan mendeteksi wajah serta gestur tanganmu. Semua gambar kamera diproses langsung di perangkatmu dan tidak pernah disimpan atau dikirim ke mana pun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ghost couldn't be summoned." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu gagal dipanggil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ghost needs your camera" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hantu butuh kameramu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most polite reaper in the underworld. He always tips his hat first, and he only uses his scythe to trim the graveyard grass." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Malaikat maut paling sopan di alam baka. Dia selalu mengangkat topinya lebih dulu, dan sabitnya hanya dipakai untuk memangkas rumput kuburan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The real treasure was the crew we made along the way. Hey… do you hear coins clinking?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harta sesungguhnya adalah awak kapal yang kita temukan di perjalanan. Hei… kamu dengar bunyi koin?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treasure map… it was in your hand all along! Hold it tight!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Peta hartanya… ternyata ada di tanganmu! Genggam erat-erat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device doesn't support augmented reality." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perangkat ini tidak mendukung augmented reality."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is what Mister Q really looks like when he's angry. Clap again quickly, maybe he'll turn cute again..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beginilah wujud asli Mister Q saat sedang marah. Cepat tepuk tangan lagi, siapa tahu dia kembali imut..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilt your head" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Miringkan kepala"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch the ghost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sentuh hantunya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treasure!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harta karun!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try Again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coba Lagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuna!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tuna!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibration" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Getaran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wave your hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lambaikan tangan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wavy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wavy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wavy waves at everyone he floats past. Nobody ever waves back, because nobody can see him... except you. Wave back!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wavy melambai pada semua orang yang dia lewati. Tidak ada yang membalas, karena tidak ada yang bisa melihatnya... kecuali kamu. Balas lambaiannya!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wheee! My broom can't steer! Point the way, quick!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wiii! Sapuku tidak bisa belok! Tunjukkan arahnya, cepat!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHO MADE MISTER Q SOFT?! Was it YOU?!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SIAPA YANG MEMBUAT MISTER Q LEMBEK?! KAMU, YA?!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoosh!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wusss!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wink" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kedipkan satu mata"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YOU CAN SEE ME! Quick, let's take a picture. Peace sign!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KAMU BISA MELIHATKU! Cepat, ayo foto bareng. Tanda damai!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You found me?! Catch me, quick, grab me!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kamu menemukanku?! Tangkap aku, cepat, genggam aku!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "YOU WIN! GAME OVER… CONTINUE? Mister Q is waiting back at level 1." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KAMU MENANG! GAME OVER… LANJUT? Mister Q menunggu di level 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your fortune says… you're not sad at all! Uh-oh. Someone is furious that I turned nice…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Garis nasibmu bilang… kamu sama sekali tidak sedih! Gawat. Ada yang marah besar karena aku jadi baik…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ghost photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Foto hantumu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your hand went right through me again… Tilt your head closer, I want to whisper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tanganmu menembusku lagi… Miringkan kepalamu, aku mau berbisik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is on my list… Please stay very still while I take measurements." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nama Anda ada di daftar saya… Mohon diam sebentar, saya sedang mengukur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yum!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nyam!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zzz… purrr… zzz… (Shh, don't wake her up.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zzz… grrr… zzz… (Ssst, jangan bangunkan dia.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "…Not bad, human. Now puff your cheeks and blow my anger away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…Lumayan juga, manusia. Sekarang gembungkan pipimu dan tiup amarahku pergi."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
